# Expo Router routes

- Auth: `app/(auth)/login|signup|forgot`, OAuth callback `app/auth/callback.tsx`
- Tabs: `app/(tabs)/novels` (Library), `journal`, `account`
- Workspace: `app/novels/[id].tsx` — Plan / Write / Board / Codex / Settings
- Journal entry: `app/journal/[id].tsx`
- Guards: `AuthProvider` + redirect in `(auth)` / `(tabs)` layouts
- Do not add Astro `src/pages/` routes; this app is Expo-only
